**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/dist
**/.venv
**/*.pyc
.git
.github
.claude
.worktrees
.superpowers
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.coverage
coverage
htmlcov
logs
tests
docs
deploy
docker
scripts
*.md
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile*
# GUI image builds from its own context (src/uvo-gui-react)
src/uvo-gui-react
